  "policies": [
    "Stickybomb Saboteur uses ordinary AddToHand to give the current opponent a native 2-cost Sabotage; ordinary capacity/overflow and battlecry timing are shared.",
    "CostAuraSpec.hand_adjacent is limited to one native ordinary spell aura with friendly CostSpec(delta=1). Only the current physical hand neighbors of the quoted actual card contribute. No permanent cost enchantment, mutable neighbor cache or generated prospective hand slot.",
    "Both native sources can tax one current neighbor; adjacent Sabotages tax each other. Payment captures original current hand order. Once the subject leaves hand, later accepted-hand window quotes have no current hand neighbors; the paid receipt preserves the original charge.",
